<title>USA: BOXING-FOREMAN, 48, BEATS A GAME SAVARESE ON SPLIT DECISION.</title>
<headline>BOXING-FOREMAN, 48, BEATS A GAME SAVARESE ON SPLIT DECISION.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, New Jersey 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>George Foreman won a punishing 12-round heavyweight fight in a split decision against a game Lou Savarese, who traded punches toe-to-toe with the former champion for 12 rounds on Saturday.</p>
</text>
